{"translation-revision-date":"YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/onboarding.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Model":[""],"3D Viewer":[""],"Customize":[""],"Publish":[""],"Setup progress":[""],"Exit Setup":[""],"Easy Setup":[""],"Upload your 3D model and configure in minutes.":[""],"Interactive Experience":[""],"Let your visitors rotate, zoom and explore.":[""],"Works Everywhere":[""],"Built for WordPress, works on all devices.":[""],"3D Viewer tutorial video":[""],"Close video":[""],"Hello %s \ud83d\udc4b":[""],"Welcome to 3D Viewer":[""],"Bring your products to life with interactive 3D models. Let's set up your first model and get started in just a few steps.":[""],"A 3D model of a lounge chair with rotate, zoom, pan and AR view controls":[""],"Need help?":[""],"Watch the 2-minute tutorial":[""],"Let's Get Started":[""],"2nd step":[""],"What's included with 3D Viewer?":[""],"Everything you need to create interactive 3D experiences on your WordPress site. Your licence is active, so every feature below is unlocked.":[""],"Everything marked Included works right now on the free version. Pro unlocks the rest whenever you need it.":[""],"Wide Format Support":[""],"GLB, GLTF, OBJ, STL, FBX, DAE, 3DS, and more \u2014 upload the file you already have.":[""],"Gutenberg & Elementor":[""],"Place a model with a block, the Elementor widget, or a shortcode anywhere.":[""],"WooCommerce Viewers":[""],"Show a rotatable 3D model above, below, or instead of the product gallery.":[""],"Responsive & Mobile Ready":[""],"Adapts to any screen, with touch controls and a poster image while loading.":[""],"Augmented Reality":[""],"View models in the room with WebXR, Scene Viewer, and iOS Quick Look.":[""],"Hotspots & Initial View":[""],"Annotate parts of the model and choose the exact camera angle it opens on.":[""],"And much more":[""],"Lighting, shadow and exposure control, axis locking, auto-rotate and fullscreen options.":[""],"Axis locking, auto-rotate, custom camera angle and hotspot annotations.":[""],"Included":[""],"Pro":[""],"Back":[""],"Upgrade to Pro":[""],"Next":[""],"Shortcode":[""],"Paste [3d_viewer id=\"\u2026\"] into any post or widget":[""],"Gutenberg":[""],"Insert the 3D Model Viewer block in the editor":[""],"Elementor":[""],"Drag the Model Viewer widget into a section":[""],"Last step":[""],"How will you add models?":[""],"Pick how you usually build pages and the steps below will match. You can still use any of the other methods later.":[""],"Preferred method":[""],"Three ways to add a model \u2014 pick one above for step-by-step instructions:":[""],"Edit with Elementor":[""],"Open any page in the editor.":[""],"Drag the widget":[""],"Find Model Viewer in the widget panel.":[""],"Set the model file":[""],"Pick a model and publish.":[""],"Add a 3D model":[""],"3D Viewer \u2192 Add New, then save.":[""],"Copy the shortcode":[""],"Shown after saving the model.":[""],"Paste it anywhere":[""],"Any post, page, widget or builder.":[""],"Add the block":[""],"Search for \"3D Model Viewer\" in the editor.":[""],"Paste the model URL":[""],"Or upload a file from the Media Library.":[""],"The viewer renders on the page.":[""],"Go to Dashboard":[""],"Add Your First 3D Model":[""]}}}